# data/coaching/aram_item_interaction.json is deliberately TRACKED (2026-07-30).
# It is the ONLY source of deterministic item_build_reasons
# (dashboard/_deterministic_coaching.py cue_reasons), the loader degrades to {}
# in total silence when it is absent, and its sole regen input
# (data/rewind_history.db, 1.87 GB, ignored above) can never be in a clean
# checkout. Refresh with tools/aram_item_interaction_precompute.py; the payload
# carries no wall-clock field, so a re-run over an unchanged corpus is
# byte-identical. Guarded by tests/test_aram_item_interaction_snapshot_tracked.py
# - do not re-add an ignore line for it.
data/post_game_rubric_weights.json
data/cc_conditional_calibration.json
data/decisions_heartbeat.json
data/top8_list.json
data/cs_archetype_picks.json
