# Tencent 101.qq raw scrape payloads - third-party data, never commit.
#
# The glob below used to be `qq_double_*.json` ONLY, which never matched the
# name the capture tooling actually writes (`101qq_<...>.json`), so
# `data/external/101qq_hero_rank_double_tier200_capture_20260525.json` was
# committed and `git check-ignore` exits 1 on it to this day. Widened here.
#
# NOTE the already-tracked exception: that May-25 capture and
# `101qq_id_map.json` are BOTH read by `core/smoothed_rates_101qq.py` - the
# capture IS the static seed the duo-synergy lane falls back to when the live
# endpoint is unreachable (item-277), so it is load-bearing, not scrap.
# Listing a tracked file here does NOT untrack it. Before publishing, that seed
# should be re-expressed in RC's own schema rather than shipped as a verbatim
# vendor response - the same transformation the lolmath extracts need.
data/external/qq_double_raw.json
data/external/qq_double_*.json
data/external/101qq_*_capture_*.json

